  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (e.g., config_038) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests scvi_n200 with resnet50 image encoder and concat fusion, which could clarify whether image encoder choice (resnet50 vs imagenet_vit_l) or fusion method (concat vs weighted) impacts performance. It balances exploitation of scvi_n200's effectiveness with exploration of resnet50's potential, while keeping costs moderate (estimated ~5 GPU hours)."
